---
// About: no composite exists (BACKLOG G2); ships as a simple
// Manifesto-layout text page per the founder's default. Nothing here is
// invented: no team bios, no origin story, only what the repositories
// already say about themselves.
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
---
<Site
  title="About · KeepState"
  description="KeepState is the durable agent session cloud. What the company is, how it works in two repositories, and why every claim on this site cites its gate."
>
  <main class="max-w-[1180px] mx-auto px-7 pt-20 pb-24 w-full">
    <div class="max-w-[62ch]">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-5">
        <span class="w-[7px] h-[7px] bg-claret rotate-45 block"></span>
        <span class="text-11 font-semibold tracking-[0.16em] uppercase text-claret">About</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-34 leading-tight tracking-tight font-normal mt-0 mb-7">The company that keeps the state.</h1>

      <p class="font-serif text-17 leading-relaxed text-slate mt-0 mb-5">KeepState is the durable agent session cloud. AI agents run inside microVMs whose entire state can be checkpointed, killed, resumed, forked, and replayed. Sessions survive <code class="font-mono text-14 bg-parchment rounded-2 px-1">kill -9</code>: that sentence is not a slogan, it is a gated claim, and the gate that proves it is public.</p>

      <p class="font-serif text-17 leading-relaxed text-slate mt-0 mb-5">The discipline extends to this website. Every claim on the site cites its gate; a number without evidence does not appear, and missing data renders as unavailable rather than zero. The full inventory of what we claim, what proves it, and what we deliberately do not claim lives on the <a href="/proof" class="text-claret no-underline hover:text-ink hover:underline underline-offset-2">Proof page</a>.</p>

      <p class="font-serif text-17 leading-relaxed text-slate mt-0 mb-5">We work in two repositories, on purpose. The product repository holds the code, the gates that test it, and the claims file those gates keep honest. This website lives in a second repository that treats the product repository as read-only input: the Proof page is generated from the product's claims file, and a hand edit to its output fails the build. The site cannot say something the product has not proven.</p>

      <p class="font-serif text-17 leading-relaxed text-slate mt-0 mb-8">KeepState was founded in 2026. There is no long company history to tell yet, and we would rather leave this page short than pad it. When there is history worth telling, it will appear here the way everything else does: with dates and evidence.</p>

      <div class="border-t border-sand pt-6 flex gap-3.5 flex-wrap">
        <a href="/manifesto" class="text-15 font-medium text-paper bg-claret px-5 py-3 rounded-3 no-underline hover:bg-claretDeep">Read the manifesto</a>
        <a href="/proof" class="text-15 font-medium text-ink bg-white border border-sand px-5 py-3 rounded-3 no-underline hover:border-ink">Read the claims file</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Site>
